Q      :       2 
PFACT  :   Crout 
NBMIN  :       2 
NDIV   :       2 
RFACT  :    Left 
BCAST  :  2ringM 
DEPTH  :       1 
SWAP   : Spread-roll (long)
L1     : no-transposed form
U      : transposed form
EQUIL  : no
ALIGN  : 8 double precision words

